    "step8_outcome_verification": {
      "primary_intent": "Collect specific, on-page metadata from the Steam store listing for Portal 2: release date, developer, publisher, the complete displayed All Reviews summary (label + sentiment + % + count), and the System Requirements OS headings plus the minimum Storage requirement shown for each heading. A reasonable user would not be flexible about missing any of these requested fields or substituting Recent/English Reviews for All Reviews; they would be flexible about minor formatting as long as the exact required values are captured.",
      "reasoning": "Nitpicks: (1) Extra commentary about what was/wasn’t visible and other non-requested details is minor. (2) Not providing a URL is fine since it wasn’t requested.\n\nCritical issues: (1) Missing primary deliverables: the agent did not provide the required All Reviews summary (label/sentiment/%/count). The DOM evidence shows only Recent Reviews and English Reviews in the captured snapshots, and the agent therefore withheld All Reviews rather than guessing; however, from the user’s perspective, the task requirement is still unmet because the All Reviews line was not recorded. (2) Missing System Requirements details: the agent did not provide the minimum Storage requirement for each OS heading, which is explicitly required. (3) Unsupported claim about OS headings: the agent asserted the System Requirements headings were “Windows” and “SteamOS + Linux,” but none of the provided DOM-model states actually show the System Requirements section or those headings; the final state also does not show them, making this at best unverified and effectively a likely hallucination given the evidence set.\n\nWhat was completed correctly: The agent did reach the correct Steam page (app/620) and correctly reported Release Date (18 Apr, 2011), Developer (Valve), and Publisher (Valve), which are explicitly supported in DOM-model state 0. The agent also complied with constraints (scrolling only; no sign-in/add-to-cart/wishlist/purchase actions).\n\nOverall outcome: The user’s main goal was to obtain a full set of specific Steam listing metadata including All Reviews and per-OS minimum Storage. Since the agent delivered only the basic metadata and failed to deliver the All Reviews summary and the per-OS Storage requirements—and additionally made an unsupported claim about OS headings—the task is not successfully completed from an average user’s perspective.",
      "output_success": false
    },
